{"id":"448130","name":"韩式鳀鱼年糕汤","author":"朝族媳妇辣白菜","authorId":"10218894","desc":"","cover":"images/448130/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"年糕片","amount":"400g"},{"name":"大葱","amount":"1根"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"},{"name":"干海带","amount":"5片"},{"name":"鳀鱼","amount":"10g"}],"sub":[{"name":"酱油","amount":"1/2勺"},{"name":"蒜末","amount":"1/2勺"},{"name":"盐","amount":"少许"},{"name":"胡椒粉","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"所需食材。","img":"images/448130/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"年糕片煮5分钟后用冷水冲一下，（冷冻年糕需要煮10-15分钟）。","img":"images/448130/step_2.gif"},{"step":3,"desc":"大葱切碎。","img":"images/448130/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"鸡蛋加少许盐后打散。","img":"images/448130/step_4.gif"},{"step":5,"desc":"L水中放入海带和鳀鱼煮开。","img":"images/448130/step_5.gif"},{"step":6,"desc":"煮开后捞出，留汤。","img":"images/448130/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"汤中加入年糕片，煮开后放入蒜末、酱油煮2分钟。","img":"images/448130/step_7.gif"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入盐后再次煮开，放入葱末煮30秒。","img":"images/448130/step_8.gif"},{"step":9,"desc":"打入鸡蛋液煮10秒即可。","img":"images/448130/step_9.gif"},{"step":10,"desc":"装盘盛出即可。","img":"images/448130/step_10.gif"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}